            "block_content": "Retention offers and equity salary adjustments shall be at the sole discretion of the University, however equity salary adjustments shall be discussed with United Academics prior to implementation. Unit members may challenge University decisions made pursuant to Article 15.4.2. Such decisions shall be considered substantive academic judgments.",
