        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The University and United Academics are committed to the recruitment and retention of high quality faculty members. To this end, based on a market salary analysis conducted by the University and United Academics, the University shall distribute two percent (2%) in each year of the contract to unit members whose salaries are under external market targets or need to be adjusted due to internal misalignments. These percentage amounts will be calculated on the total base payroll of unit members as of March 1, 2004, 2005 and 2006, and will be applied to base nine (9) month salaries effective the first full pay period after July 1 of 2004, 2005 and 2006.",
